{"id":245,"slug":"245-constructor-function-va-new-keyword-hoat-dong-nhu-the-nao","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"this & Binding","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Constructor function và new keyword hoạt động như thế nào?","question_en":"How do constructor functions and the new keyword work?","answer_vi":"Gọi `new Foo()` khiến JavaScript làm **bốn việc** theo thứ tự:\n\n```javascript\nfunction Person(name) {\n  // 1. một object rỗng được tạo\n  // 2. prototype của nó = Person.prototype\n  // 3. this = object đó, rồi thân hàm chạy\n  this.name = name\n  // 4. tự động return this — trừ khi bạn return một object khác\n}\n\nconst p = new Person('Định')\np.name                              // 'Định'\nObject.getPrototypeOf(p) === Person.prototype   // true\n```\n\nTự cài lại `new` để thấy rõ:\n\n```javascript\nfunction myNew(Ctor, ...args) {\n  const obj = Object.create(Ctor.prototype)   // bước 1 + 2\n  const ret = Ctor.apply(obj, args)           // bước 3\n  return typeof ret === 'object' && ret !== null ? ret : obj   // bước 4\n}\n```\n\nQuy tắc ở bước 4 hay bị hỏi: **return giá trị nguyên thuỷ thì bị bỏ qua**, chỉ return object mới ghi đè được `this`.\n\n```javascript\nfunction A() { this.x = 1; return 42 }        // bỏ qua → { x: 1 }\nfunction B() { this.x = 1; return { y: 2 } }  // ghi đè → { y: 2 }\n```\n\n**Lưu ý:** quên `new` với constructor kiểu function — `this` thành `undefined` (strict) hoặc `globalThis` (sloppy), và code âm thầm ghi biến ra global thay vì báo lỗi. Đây là một lý do `class` ra đời: gọi class mà thiếu `new` thì **ném TypeError ngay**","answer_en":"Calling `new Foo()` makes JavaScript do **four things** in order:\n\n```javascript\nfunction Person(name) {\n  // 1. an empty object is created\n  // 2. its prototype is set to Person.prototype\n  // 3. this = that object, then the body runs\n  this.name = name\n  // 4. this is returned automatically — unless you return another object\n}\n\nconst p = new Person('Dinh')\np.name                              // 'Dinh'\nObject.getPrototypeOf(p) === Person.prototype   // true\n```\n\nReimplementing `new` makes it concrete:\n\n```javascript\nfunction myNew(Ctor, ...args) {\n  const obj = Object.create(Ctor.prototype)   // steps 1 + 2\n  const ret = Ctor.apply(obj, args)           // step 3\n  return typeof ret === 'object' && ret !== null ? ret : obj   // step 4\n}\n```\n\nThe step-4 rule is a favorite follow-up: **returning a primitive is ignored**; only returning an object overrides `this`.\n\n```javascript\nfunction A() { this.x = 1; return 42 }        // ignored -> { x: 1 }\nfunction B() { this.x = 1; return { y: 2 } }  // overrides -> { y: 2 }\n```\n\n**Note:** forgetting `new` with a function constructor — `this` becomes `undefined` (strict) or `globalThis` (sloppy), and the code quietly writes globals instead of failing. This is one reason `class` exists: calling a class without `new` **throws a TypeError immediately**","answer_html_vi":"<p>Gọi <code>new Foo()</code> khiến JavaScript làm <strong>bốn việc</strong> theo thứ tự:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function Person(name) {\n  // 1. một object rỗng được tạo\n  // 2. prototype của nó = Person.prototype\n  // 3. this = object đó, rồi thân hàm chạy\n  this.name = name\n  // 4. tự động return this — trừ khi bạn return một object khác\n}\n\nconst p = new Person('Định')\np.name                              // 'Định'\nObject.getPrototypeOf(p) === Person.prototype   // true\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Person</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">name</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 1. một object rỗng được tạo</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 2. prototype của nó = Person.prototype</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 3. this = object đó, rồi thân hàm chạy</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">name</span> = name\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 4. tự động return this — trừ khi bạn return một object khác</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> p = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Person</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Định&#x27;</span>)\np.<span class=\"hljs-property\">name</span>                              <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;Định&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getPrototypeOf</span>(p) === <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Person</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">prototype</span></span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true</span></code></pre></div><p>Tự cài lại <code>new</code> để thấy rõ:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function myNew(Ctor, ...args) {\n  const obj = Object.create(Ctor.prototype)   // bước 1 + 2\n  const ret = Ctor.apply(obj, args)           // bước 3\n  return typeof ret === 'object' &amp;&amp; ret !== null ? ret : obj   // bước 4\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">myNew</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">Ctor, ...args</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> obj = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">create</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Ctor</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">prototype</span></span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// bước 1 + 2</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> ret = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Ctor</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">apply</span>(obj, args)           <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// bước 3</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> ret === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;object&#x27;</span> &amp;&amp; ret !== <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span> ? ret : obj   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// bước 4</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p>Quy tắc ở bước 4 hay bị hỏi: <strong>return giá trị nguyên thuỷ thì bị bỏ qua</strong>, chỉ return object mới ghi đè được <code>this</code>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function A() { this.x = 1; return 42 }        // bỏ qua → { x: 1 }\nfunction B() { this.x = 1; return { y: 2 } }  // ghi đè → { y: 2 }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">A</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">x</span> = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>; <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">42</span> }        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// bỏ qua → { x: 1 }</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">B</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">x</span> = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>; <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">y</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span> } }  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ghi đè → { y: 2 }</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> quên <code>new</code> với constructor kiểu function — <code>this</code> thành <code>undefined</code> (strict) hoặc <code>globalThis</code> (sloppy), và code âm thầm ghi biến ra global thay vì báo lỗi.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Đây là một lý do <code>class</code> ra đời: gọi class mà thiếu <code>new</code> thì <strong>ném TypeError ngay</strong>.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>Calling <code>new Foo()</code> makes JavaScript do <strong>four things</strong> in order:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function Person(name) {\n  // 1. an empty object is created\n  // 2. its prototype is set to Person.prototype\n  // 3. this = that object, then the body runs\n  this.name = name\n  // 4. this is returned automatically — unless you return another object\n}\n\nconst p = new Person('Dinh')\np.name                              // 'Dinh'\nObject.getPrototypeOf(p) === Person.prototype   // true\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">Person</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">name</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 1. an empty object is created</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 2. its prototype is set to Person.prototype</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 3. this = that object, then the body runs</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">name</span> = name\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 4. this is returned automatically — unless you return another object</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> p = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Person</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Dinh&#x27;</span>)\np.<span class=\"hljs-property\">name</span>                              <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;Dinh&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getPrototypeOf</span>(p) === <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Person</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">prototype</span></span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// true</span></code></pre></div><p>Reimplementing <code>new</code> makes it concrete:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function myNew(Ctor, ...args) {\n  const obj = Object.create(Ctor.prototype)   // steps 1 + 2\n  const ret = Ctor.apply(obj, args)           // step 3\n  return typeof ret === 'object' &amp;&amp; ret !== null ? ret : obj   // step 4\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">myNew</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">Ctor, ...args</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> obj = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Object</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">create</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Ctor</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">prototype</span></span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// steps 1 + 2</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> ret = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Ctor</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">apply</span>(obj, args)           <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// step 3</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> ret === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;object&#x27;</span> &amp;&amp; ret !== <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span> ? ret : obj   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// step 4</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p>The step-4 rule is a favorite follow-up: <strong>returning a primitive is ignored</strong>; only returning an object overrides <code>this</code>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function A() { this.x = 1; return 42 }        // ignored -&gt; { x: 1 }\nfunction B() { this.x = 1; return { y: 2 } }  // overrides -&gt; { y: 2 }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">A</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">x</span> = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>; <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">42</span> }        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ignored -&gt; { x: 1 }</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">B</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">this</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">x</span> = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>; <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">y</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span> } }  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// overrides -&gt; { y: 2 }</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Note:</strong> forgetting <code>new</code> with a function constructor — <code>this</code> becomes <code>undefined</code> (strict) or <code>globalThis</code> (sloppy), and the code quietly writes globals instead of failing.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">This is one reason <code>class</code> exists: calling a class without <code>new</code> <strong>throws a TypeError immediately</strong>.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — new operator","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/new"},{"label":"MDN — Object.create()","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Object/create"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/201-su-khac-biet-giua-var-let-va-const-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa var, let và const là gì?"},{"url":"/q/202-javascript-co-nhung-kieu-du-lieu-nguyen-thuy-primitive-types-nao","title":"JavaScript có những kiểu dữ liệu nguyên thuỷ (primitive types) nào?"},{"url":"/q/205-symbol-trong-javascript-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Symbol trong JavaScript là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/207-toan-tu-va-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Toán tử == và === khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/208-type-coercion-ep-kieu-tu-dong-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Type coercion (ép kiểu tự động) trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/209-truthy-va-falsy-values-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Truthy và falsy values trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/210-nan-la-gi-tai-sao-nan-nan","title":"NaN là gì? Tại sao NaN !== NaN?"},{"url":"/q/211-hoisting-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Hoisting trong JavaScript là gì?"}]}